. *****************************************************************************
> ***
.                                 /* Create and recode variables for H1-H4  */
. *****************************************************************************
> ***
. 
. 
. * Generate age
. gen age = syear - gebjahr

. 
. ** First child is a girl
. 
. gen first_daughter = kidsex01 == 2 if inlist(kidsex01, 1, 2)

. rename kidgeb01 first_byear

.         
. 
. ********************************* Outcomes **********************************
> **
. 
. ** H1 and H4: support for gender equality measured by attitudes ** 
. 
. * plh0301 plh0303 plh0304 plh0309 plh0308_v1 plh0302_v1 plh0298_v1 in 2012
. * plh0323 plh0324 plh0329 in 2013 -- disagreements regarding housework, child
> care, etc.
. 
. * plh0308_v2 plh0302_v2 plh0298_v2 in 2018 -- these have the most answers
. * plj0620 plj0621 plj0622 plj0623 plj0624 plj0625 in 2016 2017, 2018 is almos
> t fully missing
. 
. 
. /* Use plh0298_* plh0302_* and plh0308_* because these have the most observat
> ions
>         1- fully agree, max number = fully disagree. 
>         In 0298 and 0302, agree is least equal, in 0308 agree is most equal *
> /
.         
.         
. * Different scales in 2012 and 2018, so standardize them:
. 
. foreach v in plh0302_v1 plh0302_v2 plh0298_v1 plh0298_v2 plh0308_v1 plh0308_v
> 2 {
  2.         replace `v' = . if inlist(`v', -8, -5, -1)
  3.         egen z_`v' = std(`v')
  4. }
(372,934 real changes made, 372,934 to missing)
(440,015 missing values generated)
(361,648 real changes made, 361,648 to missing)
(428,729 missing values generated)
(372,920 real changes made, 372,920 to missing)
(440,001 missing values generated)
(361,658 real changes made, 361,658 to missing)
(428,739 missing values generated)
(372,979 real changes made, 372,979 to missing)
(440,060 missing values generated)
(361,659 real changes made, 361,659 to missing)
(428,740 missing values generated)

. 
. gen under3suffer = z_plh0302_v1
(440,015 missing values generated)

. replace under3suffer = z_plh0302_v2 if syear == 2018
(17,501 real changes made)

. gen under6suffer = z_plh0298_v1
(440,001 missing values generated)

. replace under6suffer = z_plh0298_v2 if syear == 2018
(17,491 real changes made)

. gen shouldworkequal = z_plh0308_v1
(440,060 missing values generated)

. replace shouldworkequal = z_plh0308_v2 if syear == 2018
(17,490 real changes made)

. 
. 
. * Create an index from the three variables *
. pca under3suffer under6suffer shouldworkequal

Principal components/correlation                 Number of obs    =     23,488
                                                 Number of comp.  =          3
                                                 Trace            =          3
    Rotation: (unrotated = principal)            Rho              =     1.0000

    --------------------------------------------------------------------------
       Component |   Eigenvalue   Difference         Proportion   Cumulative
    -------------+------------------------------------------------------------
           Comp1 |      1.80957      .845937             0.6032       0.6032
           Comp2 |      .963632      .736833             0.3212       0.9244
           Comp3 |      .226799            .             0.0756       1.0000
    --------------------------------------------------------------------------

Principal components (eigenvectors) 

    ----------------------------------------------------------
        Variable |    Comp1     Comp2     Comp3 | Unexplained 
    -------------+------------------------------+-------------
    under3suffer |   0.6919    0.1445    0.7073 |           0 
    under6suffer |   0.6915    0.1488   -0.7069 |           0 
    shouldwork~l |  -0.2074    0.9783    0.0030 |           0 
    ----------------------------------------------------------

. predict gender_attitudes, score // the larger the index, the more equal
(2 components skipped)

Scoring coefficients 
    sum of squares(column-loading) = 1

    --------------------------------------------
        Variable |    Comp1     Comp2     Comp3 
    -------------+------------------------------
    under3suffer |   0.6919    0.1445    0.7073 
    under6suffer |   0.6915    0.1488   -0.7069 
    shouldwork~l |  -0.2074    0.9783    0.0030 
